usage: module-nav find [-h] [--source] [--module FIND_MODULE] [-n N] query [query ...]

Fuzzy search in class names (camelCase-aware). See also: `rank` for a ranked class lookup.

positional arguments:
  query                 Search query words (e.g. 'alarm service')

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --source              Also search in source tokens (slower)
  --module FIND_MODULE  Filter by module
  -n N                  Limit results (default 50)
